# Allow only service/test source, teacher web assets and schemas.
# TrainingDataset/ (per-class training images), models and secrets are excluded
# by the default deny rule. Never bake classroom drawings or reviews into images.
**
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.service
!requirements-service.txt
!pyproject.toml
!solaria_classifier/
!solaria_classifier/**
!solaria_vision/
!solaria_vision/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!docs/
!docs/schemas/
!docs/schemas/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
